    "checks": [
      {
        "index": 0,
        "text": "Narrator: You will hear a woman telephoning a member of staff at a local newspaper.",
        "sourceLabel": "Narrator",
        "start": 8.88,
        "end": 13.28,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.9879,
          "Steven": 0.2398,
          "Woman": 0.7195
        },
        "chosen": "Narrator"
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "Steven: Subscriber services. This is Steven, may I help you?",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 103.68,
        "end": 107.22,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.2056,
          "Steven": 0.7705,
          "Woman": 0.2583
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Woman: Good morning, Steven. I'm calling because I'd like to get a copy of a photo of my son that came out in the newspaper last week.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 107.66,
        "end": 115.38,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.7318,
          "Steven": 0.2683,
          "Woman": 0.9083
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Steven: Sure, I can help you with that. Do you have the exact date?",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 115.96,
        "end": 119.48,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.3323,
          "Steven": 0.7934,
          "Woman": 0.3203
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "Woman: Yes. It was last Monday. That was March the 10th.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 119.85,
        "end": 125.43,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.5096,
          "Steven": 0.4189,
          "Woman": 0.7491
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "text": "Steven: Okay, sure. Just one moment pleaseâ€”okay, I have the newspaper from that date on my computer screen now. What section was it in?",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 127.59,
        "end": 137.01,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.226,
          "Steven": 0.9276,
          "Woman": 0.3214
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "text": "Woman: It was a feature story on local high school athletes.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 137.39,
        "end": 140.65,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.4153,
          "Steven": 0.2148,
          "Woman": 0.76
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "text": "Steven: Okay, so local athletes are always on the back page.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 141.27,
        "end": 145.35,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.1606,
          "Steven": 0.8338,
          "Woman": 0.2455
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "text": "Woman: No, I don't remember it being at the back. I clearly remember it being on the front.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 145.79,
        "end": 151.46,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.6002,
          "Steven": 0.2235,
          "Woman": 0.8348
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "text": "Steven: Oh, you're right, we just started doing those features there in the last several editions. Which story was it?",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 152.16,
        "end": 159.46,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.2024,
          "Steven": 0.8493,
          "Woman": 0.2913
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 10,
        "text": "Woman: Student Athlete of the month? Oops, no, excuse me, I'm sorryâ€”I mean week.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 160,
        "end": 164.78,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.607,
          "Steven": 0.2697,
          "Woman": 0.8413
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 11,
        "text": "Steven: And that's your son? You must be very proud of him, that's quite an accomplishment. Ah yes, here it isâ€”Chase Parkers, baseball player.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 165.48,
        "end": 175.48,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.2924,
          "Steven": 0.9073,
          "Woman": 0.3428
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 12,
        "text": "Woman: That's him. But actually the reporter got his surname wrongâ€”it should be Parkhurst, that's P-A-R-K-H-U-R-S-T.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 176.51,
        "end": 183.45,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.5346,
          "Steven": 0.273,
          "Woman": 0.8667
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 13,
        "text": "Steven: Okay, I'll make a note of that. Now, I'm assuming this photo is just for your own use, not for additional reprinting? With copyright laws, you need to fill out an extra form if you're going to reprint the photo in another publication.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 187.37,
        "end": 197.37,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.1846,
          "Steven": 0.9414,
          "Woman": 0.2721
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 14,
        "text": "Woman: Oh I see, no, it's not for business or commercial purposes or anything, it's just for personal use. I want everyone who visits our home to see it, I'm so proud of him.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 205.62,
        "end": 215.62,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.6706,
          "Steven": 0.2273,
          "Woman": 0.9428
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 15,
        "text": "Steven: Of course. Now, I don't know if you knew this, but even though the photo is in black and white in the paper, you can choose to get your reprint in color.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 217.58,
        "end": 227.12,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.1914,
          "Steven": 0.9532,
          "Woman": 0.2581
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 16,
        "text": "Woman: Oh, that's interesting. He does look so distinguished in the black and white, I like that. Okay, but you know what, I'll actually take the colorâ€”that way his uniform will really stand out.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 227.72,
        "end": 237.72,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.4726,
          "Steven": 0.3858,
          "Woman": 0.8655
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 17,
        "text": "Steven: What else? Oh yes, of course, sizeâ€”what size would you like? You can have the standard size or the wallet size.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 285.98,
        "end": 294.44,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.1517,
          "Steven": 0.8585,
          "Woman": 0.258
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 18,
        "text": "Woman: Um, no, not the small one, these wallet sized ones aren't helpful as I'd like to frame it.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 294.8,
        "end": 300.48,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.628,
          "Steven": 0.2617,
          "Woman": 0.8464
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 19,
        "text": "Woman: Can I get more than one?",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 302.62,
        "end": 303.88,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.5623,
          "Steven": 0.2459,
          "Woman": 0.7729
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "text": "Steven: Yes, extra copies of the same print are discounted 50% if you order them at the same time.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 304.44,
        "end": 311.44,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.248,
          "Steven": 0.8839,
          "Woman": 0.3053
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 21,
        "text": "Woman: Wow, they are quite expensive to begin with, so while I'd love a couple for the grandparents, I think I'll just stick with one. No, no, no, I'd better get threeâ€”it's a once in a lifetime thing, you know, what's a few extra dollars when it comes to memories?",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 312.48,
        "end": 322.48,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.7217,
          "Steven": 0.2909,
          "Woman": 0.891
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 22,
        "text": "Steven: Okay, so the total on that will be $80. Would you like to add rush processing? Rush processing will add $15 to your order.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 330.27,
        "end": 340.27,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.3191,
          "Steven": 0.8335,
          "Woman": 0.4765
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 23,
        "text": "Woman: Oh really, huh, that's quite expensive. I do want to get them quickly, but I guess I can be patient tooâ€”so yeah, I'll just do normal processing. Is it still pretty fast?",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 345.55,
        "end": 355.55,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.6374,
          "Steven": 0.2853,
          "Woman": 0.8984
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 24,
        "text": "Steven: Usually about four to five business days.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 360,
        "end": 362.72,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.2253,
          "Steven": 0.6833,
          "Woman": 0.272
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 25,
        "text": "Woman: Oh, that's not bad at all.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 363.54,
        "end": 364.88,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.4005,
          "Steven": 0.1982,
          "Woman": 0.702
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 26,
        "text": "Steven: Is there anything else? Just the payment?",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 366.72,
        "end": 369.34,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.285,
          "Steven": 0.3563,
          "Woman": 0.5223
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 27,
        "text": "Woman: Yes, of course. Can I pay you with a credit card?",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 370.24,
        "end": 373.34,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.5444,
          "Steven": 0.2326,
          "Woman": 0.7864
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 28,
        "text": "Steven: Yes sure, we also take checks.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 373.8,
        "end": 376.38,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.1524,
          "Steven": 0.7508,
          "Woman": 0.2509
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 29,
        "text": "Woman: Oh, that's convenient, I'll do that thenâ€”I really prefer to pay by cheque rather than use my credit card.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 376.94,
        "end": 383.96,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.6363,
          "Steven": 0.2541,
          "Woman": 0.9068
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 30,
        "text": "Steven: Now when they arrive, would you like to pick them up in our office, or would you like us to send them to you?",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 384.34,
        "end": 391.14,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.1942,
          "Steven": 0.8838,
          "Woman": 0.2846
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 31,
        "text": "Woman: Ah, it's rather inconvenient for me to stop by.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 391.8,
        "end": 394.82,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.6686,
          "Steven": 0.2788,
          "Woman": 0.8609
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 32,
        "text": "Steven: I'll go ahead and mail them then, and that's no extra charge. One last question if you don't mindâ€”we routinely survey all our callers just to see how often they read the newspaper.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 395.54,
        "end": 405.54,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.2825,
          "Steven": 0.9431,
          "Woman": 0.3913
        },
        "chosen": "Steven"
      },
      {
        "index": 33,
        "text": "Woman: For years and years we read the entire paper on a daily basis. But now we're so busy, it seems we don't have time to read like we used to, except on weekends. But still, yes, you can say we read it each dayâ€”my husband still does for sure.",
        "sourceLabel": "Woman",
        "start": 409.34,
        "end": 419.34,
        "scores": {
          "Narrator": 0.7411,
          "Steven": 0.251,
          "Woman": 0.9171
        },
        "chosen": "Woman"
      },
      {
        "index": 34,
        "text": "Steven: Okay, thanks. Now ma'am, let's get your address.",
        "sourceLabel": "Steven",
        "start": 426.94,
        "end": 430.82,
        "scores": {
